       1 +# Mathematical Art                                             
       2 +                                                               
       3 +Interactive geometric visualizations, curves, fractals and anim
         +ations.                                                        
       4 +                                                               
       5 +This site is built with [Jekyll](https://jekyllrb.com/) and the
       6 +[Minimal Mistakes](https://mmistakes.github.io/minimal-mistakes
         +/) theme                                                       
       7 +(`remote_theme: mmistakes/minimal-mistakes@4.28.1`) and deploye
         +d on GitHub Pages.                                             
       8 +                                                               
       9 +## Adding a visualization                                      
      10 +                                                               
      11 +1. Drop the self-contained `.html` file at the repository root 
         +(or a subfolder).                                              
      12 +2. Add its path to `_data/visualizations.yml`.                 
      13 +3. The shell pages (`/`, `/index_search.html`, `/index_spa.html
         +`, `/index_all.html`)                                          
      14 +   generate their file lists from that data file at build time.
      15 +                                                               
      16 +## Visualizations                                              
      17 +                                                               
      18  + ['3gon_around_3gon.html', ]('3gon_around_3gon.html', )
